                        "Description": "This dataset contains properties (captured in the DDMS) that generally include mole and mass percents of: total fluid, flashed gas and flashed liquid, and individual components (e.g., C1, C2, C3\u2026). These compositional data for the flashed liquid and gas streams together with Single Stage Flash Volumtric data are used to report out overall fluid composition.",
